                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="n-1168" value="&lt;div style=&quot;box-sizing:border-box;width:900px;height:100%;padding:3px 14px 3px 16px;text-align:left;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20.8px;color:#55554d;white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:normal;word-break:normal&quot;&gt;The re-exec block inside .bashrc’s onExit is commented out: onExit only records the result. Whether the shell restarts depends on who started it (⚠ C3):&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;html=1;overflow=fill;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;arcSize=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#55554d;fontFamily=Helvetica" parent="L12" vertex="1">
